egime when it goes crazy, and try to predict it. So I actually did end up buying some better temperature probes that were more loggable than what I had!</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sDZu!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a0d4c63-5e0c-4069-9e1b-9e778e02af9c_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sDZu!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a0d4c63-5e0c-4069-9e1b-9e778e02af9c_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sDZu!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a0d4c63-5e0c-4069-9e1b-9e778e02af9c_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sDZu!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a0d4c63-5e0c-4069-9e1b-9e778e02af9c_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sDZu!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a0d4c63-5e0c-4069-9e1b-9e778e02af9c_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sDZu!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1a0d4c63-5e0c-4069-9e1b-9e778e02af9c_4032x3024.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1a0d4c63-5e0c-4069-9e1b-9e778e02af9c_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullsc