      "id": 340018825,
      "body": "Your desk organization is goals. I need to figure out an organization scheme for my new space because my current desk layout is cluttered, chaotic, and inefficient. I have spent many minutes frustrated, looking for something I just *knew* was right here\n\nI also really love the idea of making experiments with what we already have, it's akin to the idea of \"cooking with what we have at home.\" I think as long as you make considerations for safety (e.g. no chemically incompatible mixes, no inadvertent synthesis of an explosive or pyrophoric) this sounds like a wild and fun idea. Basically trying mixes to see what happens and then contextualizing the observed behavior through physical and chemical principles sounds wild and amazing and I'm here for it \ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\udffd",
